{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/Intro_Panel.png?t=1745230094\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow Om's journey from being an amateur to an excellent sitarist as his travels bring him to a city that lives and breathes music. Explore its rich culture through food, art and stories that have been passed on for centuries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/Space_Rect.jpg.png?t=1745230094\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/Title_Panel.png?t=1745230094\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/Space_Rect.jpg.png?t=1745230094\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/01.png?t=1745230094\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Play</strong> sitar,\u00a0<strong>compose</strong> your own music and<strong> customize</strong> your stage to bring more audience at your sitar shows during the weekly mela.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/Gif-01.gif?t=1745230094\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/02.png?t=1745230094\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cook</strong> a variety of local dishes. Trade with the overseas' merchants for their recipes to serve in the Dhaba.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/Gif-02.gif?t=1745230094\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/03.png?t=1745230094\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tune into the city's olden folklores through Kusum Dadi's stories every evening. <strong>Collect</strong>\u00a0and expand your collection of story cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/Gif-03.gif?t=1745230094\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/04.png?t=1745230094\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Live carefree in a city filled with colorful graffiti, gorgeous temples and a vibrant culture.\u00a0Have fun in the weekly<strong>\u00a0mela</strong> (carnival), playing games and engaging with overseas' merchants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/Gif-04.gif?t=1745230094\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/05.png?t=1745230094\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A strange boatsman. Who is he? A recurring dream that takes Om to a  familiar place or so it seems. What does it mean? Piece together the jigsaw of time to discover the riddle around the talking journal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/Gif-05.gif?t=1745230094\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/07.png?t=1745230094\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seek companionship with Siya, a fellow traveler and an artist. Go on dates, spend time together doing activities such as camel rides, exploring mela, decorating the city, or just a simple chai date along the riverbank.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/Space_Rect.jpg.png?t=1745230094\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3581900?t=1745230094","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3581900?t=1745230094","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/316744e67a4a4ea573df4bd08eed4ae0fcb25aa0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745230094","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/316744e67a4a4ea573df4bd08eed4ae0fcb25aa0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745230094"